// Ownership- and Capability-Aware Copy/Move Propagation, Deep Scalar Replacement of Aggregates (SROA),
// and Caller-Allocated Return-Slot Construction (RVO / NRVO) Engine (T064 / E15.3).
// Implements SPEC-73 §3, §8, §9 (AXS-INL-010..013, AXS-INL-034.1, AXS-INL-035):
//   - Copy propagation for `Copy` types across dominated uses with modification & observability checks (`AXS-INL-010.1`)
//   - Move propagation & move-chain coalescing with drop-flag folding & linear capability conservation (`AXS-INL-010.2`)
//   - Deep recursive SROA for `Struct`, `Tuple`, `NoEscape` `Closure` environments, small `[N]T` arrays,
//     and `Option<T>` / `Result<T, E>` / algebraic `Enum`s (`AXS-INL-011`, `AXS-INL-013`)
//   - Field-order `Drop` decomposition `(0, 1, ..., k-1)` & partial-move drop elision (`AXS-INL-011` rule 3)
//   - Direct `RVO`, named `NRVO` (`ReturnEscape` + `NoAlias`), & chained return-slot forwarding (`AXS-INL-012`)
//   - `PassManager` contract verification, transactional rollback, & deterministic `--emit=inline` SROA printer
module compiler.opt.sroa

